Tiger Analytics is a global company that uses AI and analytics to help businesses solve problems. They work with Fortune 1000 companies and other big brands. 
What they do
AI and analytics services
Tiger Analytics offers a variety of services, including ML ops, data science, and generative AI. 
Business insights
They use AI-powered insights to help businesses streamline operations, improve customer experiences, and drive growth. 
Data-driven decision-making
They help businesses make real-time decisions using structured and unstructured data. 
How they work
Collaborative approach: They work with business stakeholders, technical teams, operational users, and end customers to build custom AI/ML solutions. 
Learning experiments: They use learning experiments to achieve breakthroughs in performance. 
Where they are 
Tiger Analytics has offices and delivery centers in the US, Canada, UK, Singapore, and India.
They are a Google Cloud Platform partner.
What else they do 
They are committed to diversity, inclusion, and community service.
They work with universities to grant scholarships, develop curricula, and mentor students.
